---
title: "initialize (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: validate params
    q_validate --> q_set_refund: refundPeriodSeconds in [1h, 14d]
    q_validate --> q_revert_params: invalid params
    q_revert_params --> [*]: revert InvalidConfiguration
    q_set_refund --> q_set_fees: refundPeriodSeconds = param
    q_set_fees --> q_set_addrs: set fee bps (legion, referrer on capital + tokens)
    q_set_addrs --> q_set_tokens: set projectAdmin, addressRegistry, legionBouncer, legionSigner
    q_set_tokens --> q_init_done: bidToken = param
    q_init_done --> [*]: emit Initialized

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: refundPeriodSeconds must be between 1 hour and 14 days
        INV-002: fee bps must be valid basis points (0..10000)
        INV-003: all address params must be non-zero
    end note
